{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9963d4603e85669d165150e35b45bc32ff46d2baabeb47f6c281c927ef28fc18", "ja": "（動物園でのイベントに先んじて、\n千鶴さんと下見に来ている……）", "zh": "（在动物园活动之前，先和千鹤一起来踩点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "ef2d0acc7cec3b8f3f9c9cb948148d7cf26df49ee7abc789e5706ceb9da0d925", "ja": "まあ！　かわいらしいリスちゃんがいますわ。\nお近づきになれるといいのですけど……ふふっ♪", "zh": "哎呀！有一只可爱的小松鼠呢。\n要是能和它亲近起来就好了……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "daa0f88b526162a5fa2a64febe44777d5ebc82b7d8379af62fe4697896c07fea", "ja": "あ、千鶴さん、ポケットに\n気をつけておいた方がいいかもしれませんよ。", "zh": "啊，千鹤小姐，或许还是小心一下口袋比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "de768bd94343bf93c80d5e2e27a361ef7731e464ad435b51e790ef15486144b4", "ja": "気をつける？　なんのことですの？", "zh": "要注意？　您指的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0bf3103e42bc5f6971c989ba34cb3f13fef8aa3e2bdb0cfaf75922b4ae338914", "ja": "ここのリスは、人に慣れているみたいですから。\nエサがあると思って、飛び込んでくるかもしれません。", "zh": "这里的松鼠好像不怕人。\n它们可能会以为有食物，就直接扑过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "3fd3ce2d9e88c9943168b98444a5ace30959a194944e8fa06ea73f62693195f1", "ja": "あら……それは用心しなくてはいけませんわね。\nポケットの中、一応確認しておきましょう。", "zh": "哎呀……那可得小心提防才行呢。\n姑且确认一下口袋里面吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "99dff977576704a40e2d5c30cc6da3c7e78ff49ded6976e4099a1b4d57896d75", "ja": "とはいえ、わたくしは特に何も、\n持っていませんが……………………あっ。", "zh": "话虽如此，我身上也没特别带着什么……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1f1c61fbb10351799a89b1315a68ea3ea188eff5266c279f090308025462d1b3", "ja": "どうしました？　まさか、もうリスが……？", "zh": "怎么了？难道松鼠已经……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "bb249b8d4b95a109e4f938f866a0e30b88d1e0a3e32e2ddf37c5a4c0f21806c1", "ja": "い、いえ！　そうではなくて……お、おほほ！\nちょっと失礼いたしますわ！", "zh": "不、不是！并不是那样……哦、呵呵！\n我先失陪一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "b62c1fe688c070bdf9d8fadfbcbef174da66a9ead142d9a100e00ed6f9c1be7e", "ja": "ふう、まさか実家のポイントカードが、\nポケットに入っているとは思いませんでしたわ……。", "zh": "呼，没想到老家的积分卡居然会在口袋里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3fb5cf87061d4de7257c0d03943a641c52507fb592148ebfaace9d4423d7ad0e", "ja": "千鶴さん、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "千鹤小姐，您没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "1ebe94cc3c912f4ea30769a7fcf01f0eb5d971d4777692b65baffc342cc340dd", "ja": "えっ、ええ！　じ、実はポケットに、\n愛用のクレジットカードが入っておりまして！", "zh": "诶，嗯嗯！其、其实我的口袋里，放着一张常用的信用卡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1012_p", "source_sha256": "21dca9e73455f9d7e18509deb6991bb82e5ced1118ed3b503b413d629a119412", "ja": "おっと、それは……先にわかってよかった。\nもしリスに持っていかれたら、面倒だったでしょうし。", "zh": "哦，那还真是……幸好提前发现了。\n要是被松鼠叼走了，可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "8d2ea5c229a0f421ce8f306aa02715968c630db3aa4828e1b20afe67275de90c", "ja": "そうですとも……いえ、カードのひとつやふたつ、\nどうということはありませんけれども。", "zh": "正是如此……不过，区区一两张卡片，倒也没什么大不了的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "c41415c31d6dc849a5cf0975a70c1cb1531016b5dfdc2ba49e46667be6dd64bc", "ja": "リスちゃんが間違えて齧ったりしては、かわいそう\nですから。全て、バッグに入れておきました。", "zh": "要是被小松鼠不小心咬坏了，那就太可怜了。所以我已经全部放进包里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0233_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "426b4b239e4e64e971754a3ee42f99634abd79e1b0b70aa0db576ac228248e1c", "ja": "これで安心ですわ。さあ、リスちゃんたちと\nふれあうといたしましょう！　おーっほっほっほ！", "zh": "这样就放心了。好了，去和小松鼠们亲近亲近吧！哦呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
